The files in this folder are code generated from IzzyBlazor's block templates, kept here so the docs
site can draw each block's preview. They are not under the repository's MIT License: they are Generated
Code under the IzzyBlazor Template License (LICENSE-TEMPLATES at the repository's root). The same goes
for the pictures of blocks, starters and kits under wwwroot/img/blocks and wwwroot/img/templates.
